  "method": [
    "Mix the dough as listed, following each ingredient's note (late additions, salt timing). Let it ferment 90–120 min.",
    "Pre-knead 63 pieces of dough of 450 g, then work firmly round. Place on trays finely sprinkled with rye meal and let ferment.",
    "Cut in from the middle with dough scraper; fold up one half, place on the loading peel and let ferment briefly.",
    "Bake in warm oven with steam. Open vent halfway through baking time and finish off baking well."
  ],
